        "topic": "Tag-declaration gap blocking standard servo constructs",
        "question": "The generator could not declare a MOTION_INSTRUCTION control tag ({Axis}_MCD), additional AOI_RangeCheck backing tags, or write STRING elements into the AlarmList array, so three standard constructs (the MCD speed-change instruction, per-position/per-corner RangeCheck instances, and alarm message text) came out as placeholder rungs. Can the tag-declaration path be opened for these types so the standard shapes can be emitted, and should any build that hits this limitation be blocked from shipping rather than emitting *Replace placeholders?",
